OL,3,GNEWSAWeapons found as police trial
OL,4,Afacial recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police said officers seized
OL,7,Fweapons and made two arrests during the
OL,8,Fforce's first deployment of live facial
OL,9,Frecognition technology.
OL,11,FThe system, which compares faces
OL,12,Fcaptured in public with a police
OL,13,Fwatchlist, was used in Chatham on
OL,14,FFriday and will be deployed again on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FOfficers can use the equipment to
OL,18,Fidentify wanted criminals, people
OL,19,Fsubject to court orders and selected
OL,20,Fmissing persons, but some have raised
OL,21,Fprivacy concerns about its use.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
