OL,3,GNEWSAWeapons found as police trial
OL,4,Afacial recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FActing Supt Gary Woodward said that
OL,7,Fafter a stop and search prompted by the
OL,8,Ftechnology, police had found "somebody
OL,9,Fwith weapons" who probably would have
OL,10,Fpassed undetected previously and two
OL,11,Farrests were made within about an hour.
